cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PyPFT, please cite it using the metadata below, along with the papers it implements."
type: software
title: PyPFT
abstract: >-
  A Python toolkit for the polar Fourier transform (an angular DFT around a
  discrete Hankel transform), with applications such as reconstructing
  radially-sampled MR images from k-space.
authors:
  - alias: GhDamghani
repository-code: "https://github.com/GhDamghani/PyPFT"
license: BSD-3-Clause
keywords:
  - polar-fourier-transform
  - hankel-transform
  - fourier
  - mri
  - scientific-computing
